    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eSalsa verde is the whole budget here, so shop it.\u003c/strong\u003e Check the Hispanic aisle before the salsa aisle. The same green salsa in a taller jar with Spanish on the label is routinely half the price of the branded one up front.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eCannellini beans do double duty.\u003c/strong\u003e Mash a scoop against the side of the pot and the chili thickens without a roux, without cream, and without another dollar spent.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eBuy garlic by the head, not the jar.\u003c/strong\u003e Jarred minced garlic costs several times more per usable clove and tastes tinny in a bright dish like this one.",
